.\" Manpage for NixOS-bunker
.TH BUNKER 1 "July 2026" "nixos-bunker" "NixOS-bunker Manual"
.SH NAME
bunker \- hardened microVM workstation operator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bunker
.br
.B bunker-zone
.RI [ list | add | set | rm | \&.\&.\&. ]
.br
.B bunker-zone-start
.IR zone
.br
.B bunker-sflc
.RI [ unlock | lock | status ]
.br
.B bunker-panic
.SH DESCRIPTION
Host GNOME is a thin shell. Apps run in microVM
.BR zones .
Brokers:
.BR net ,
.BR usb ,
.BR voice .
One TUI:
.BR bunker .
.SH FILES
.I config/zones.json
— source of truth (
.BR apps[] ,
.BR mem ,
.BR diskGb ,
.BR invisible ,
.BR layer ,
.BR panic ).
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR docs/deniable.md ,
.IR docs/egress.md ,
.IR docs/usb.md ,
.IR docs/ADMIN-RECOVER.md
